.el .ds Aq '
.TH rayscan-merge 1  "merge " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-merge \- Merge reports from distributed/sharded scans into one report
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmerge\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-jsonl\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Merge reports from distributed/sharded scans into one report
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write the merged report to a file instead of stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-jsonl\fR
Emit one JSON result per line instead of a single report object
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
Input scan reports in JSON or JSONL format. Repeatable
